{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/肃清之誓","pageid":9290,"revid":22594,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%82%83%E6%B8%85%E4%B9%8B%E8%AA%93&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%82%83%E6%B8%85%E4%B9%8B%E8%AA%93&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%82%83%E6%B8%85%E4%B9%8B%E8%AA%93&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>肃清之誓</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.82.83.E6.B8.85.E4.B9.8B.E8.AA.93\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"肃清之誓\"><b>肃清之誓</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 攻击姿态.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/0pivsgkk3rlty6p9j3p02ob3v28prrc.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%A7%BF%E6%80%81.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f9/0pivsgkk3rlty6p9j3p02ob3v28prrc.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%A7%BF%E6%80%81.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f9/0pivsgkk3rlty6p9j3p02ob3v28prrc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />肃清之誓\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（支援）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">肃清之誓</span>]（持续2回合），效果：<br />✦自身物防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>加成在物攻值上，并根据自身拥有的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"防御加护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">防御加护</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤</font></span></span>]系列、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物防</span>]系列、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔防</span>]系列的总层数，每层使物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，最多提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>。<br />✦受到伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%87%E5%9B%BD%E5%89%91%E7%9B%BE%E5%85%B5(%E5%8F%AC%E5%94%A4)\" title=\"角色图鉴库/法皇国剑盾兵(召唤)\"><img alt=\"头像 法皇国剑盾兵(召唤).png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/94/9tht87620kv9wkffmvezm15tczfk5v9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">法皇国剑盾兵(召唤)</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" st